flowchart TD
  %% =========================
  %% SIGNAL INTAKE (agnostic)
  %% =========================
  A0[Signal Received] --> A1{Signal type?}
  A1 -->|SIEM alert| S1[SIEMAdapter: ingest + correlate]
  A1 -->|SOAR container/case| S2[SourceHydratorService: hydrate from SOAR]
  A1 -->|IOC / Intel| S3[ThreatIntelAdapter: IOC enrich]
  A1 -->|EDR detection| S4[EDRAdapter: endpoint telemetry]
  A1 -->|Vuln finding| S5[VulnerabilityAdapter: CVE exposure context]
  A1 -->|Other| S6[Normalize minimal signal fields]

  %% =========================
  %% PHASE 1 / 1.5 / 2
  %% =========================
  S1 --> P1
  S2 --> P1
  S3 --> P1
  S4 --> P1
  S5 --> P1
  S6 --> P1

  P1[PHASE 1: CaseBootstrapService\nBuild case graph + deterministic case ID] --> P15
  P15[PHASE 1.5: CanonicalizeService\nNormalize entities + dedupe] --> P2
  P2[PHASE 2: SourceHydratorService\nHydrate missing payloads only if needed] --> Q1{"Have detection data<br/>(SIEM/EDR events)?"}

  %% =========================
  %% PHASE 3 ENRICHMENT (delta-aware)
  %% =========================
  Q1 -->|Yes| P3["PHASE 3: EnrichmentService\nMulti-source enrichment (delta optimized)"]
  Q1 -->|No| P3b[PHASE 3: EnrichmentService\nIOC-only enrichment + evidence gap noted]

  P3 --> P3x
  P3b --> P3x
  P3x[Add CMDB + ownership + criticality\nCMDBAdapter] --> P4

  %% =========================
  %% PHASE 4 / 5 ANALYTICS
  %% =========================
  P4[PHASE 4: HistoricalDataService\nFetch time-series tracks] --> P5
  P5[PHASE 5: ForecastingService\nMulti-track ETS forecast + trend/anomaly context] --> P6

  %% =========================
  %% PHASE 6 CONTEXT LINKING
  %% =========================
  P6[PHASE 6: CaseContextLinkingService\nSimilar cases + correlation + artifact harvest] --> P7

  %% =========================
  %% PHASE 7 CLASSIFICATION
  %% =========================
  P7[PHASE 7: ClassificationService\nDisposition TP/FP/REVIEW + confidence] --> D1{Disposition?}

  %% =========================
  %% PHASE 8 / 9 / 10 ACTIONS + GOVERNANCE
  %% =========================
  D1 -->|TRUE POSITIVE| P8
  D1 -->|FALSE POSITIVE| P8
  D1 -->|REVIEW| P8

  P8[PHASE 8: RunbookRegistry\nMatch runbooks/playbooks] --> P9
  P9["PHASE 9: ActionProposalService\nRanked proposals (6 channels)"] --> P10
  P10[PHASE 10: GovernanceGate\nMark actions as auto_execute / requires_approval / blocked] --> D2{Auto-close eligible?}

  %% =========================
  %% AUTO-CLOSE WHERE APPLICABLE
  %% =========================
  D2 -->|Yes| AC[Auto-close or auto-resolve\nper governance] --> P11
  D2 -->|No| P11

  %% =========================
  %% PHASE 11 AI OVERLAY (OPTIONAL)
  %% =========================
  P11[PHASE 11: AIService - optional\nOverlay summaries bounded to evidence] --> P12

  %% =========================
  %% PHASE 12 REPORT RENDER (ALWAYS)
  %% =========================
  P12[PHASE 12: ReportService\nRender triage packet (markdown)] --> OUT[Output: SOC Triage Packet\nTP or FP or REVIEW]
